 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Player autoplay and audio
+
+- The overlay accepts autoplay (default false) and muted options, forwarded to
+  both Shaka and Bitmovin. User-initiated movie, trailer, programme, series and
+  demo playback passes autoplay true and muted false to request audio.
+- Requires the player package rebuilt after applying the companion player patch.
+  Browser permissions may still block audible autoplay; Play remains available.
+
 ### Fixed
 
 Updated scripts/sync-white-label-player.js to check for pack-web.js instead of pack-web.sh
